      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 1000\n    current_rate = 0.08\n    up_rate = 0.10\n    down_rate = 0.06\n    probability_up = 0.50\n    probability_down = 0.50\n    annual_duration_risk_premium = 0.004\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    expected_rate_after_one_year = (\n        probability_up * up_rate + probability_down * down_rate\n    )\n    risk_adjusted_rate = expected_rate_after_one_year + annual_duration_risk_premium\n    bond_value = face_value / ((1 + current_rate) * (1 + risk_adjusted_rate))\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(bond_value, 3)\n```",
